    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Education Classes WordPress Theme is a modern and highly functional theme tailored for education-focused websites. Whether you're building a platform for online learning, virtual classrooms, or higher education, it offers all the tools needed to create a compelling and user-friendly portal. With its clean layout, responsive design, and intuitive navigation, it supports course creation, lesson planning, and student assessment through integration with popular learning management systems. Key features include online quizzes, academic calendars, virtual labs, and multimedia content support such as videos, webinars, and eBooks. The theme also provides customizable banners, portals for students and teachers, and tools to manage schedules, scholarship programs, and parent-teacher meetings. Ideal for educators, tutors, and institutions offering a wide range of learning programs, it offers a professional solution for delivering engaging educational experiences online."
    },
